WEBVTT

00:01:44.720 --> 00:01:47.310
Come on, hurry up!

00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:56.380
I said it was too
heavy for you, didn't I?

00:01:56.380 --> 00:01:57.940
Hand it to me!

00:01:57.940 --> 00:02:00.180
No, I can hold it!

00:02:00.180 --> 00:02:02.880
Nicely done.
Good for you!

00:02:02.880 --> 00:02:04.720
You're so stubborn!

00:02:20.880 --> 00:02:22.240
Okay.

00:02:30.300 --> 00:02:36.550
The final stage of the Beyblade world championships are about to begin!

00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:40.710
Like it or not, everything will
be decided here in Australia!

00:02:40.710 --> 00:02:43.980
Now let's take
a look at the slides!

00:02:43.980 --> 00:02:46.960
Neo-Borg has won three
out of four matches!

00:02:46.960 --> 00:02:51.970
Barthez Soldat has one win,
and every other team is at two wins.

00:02:51.970 --> 00:02:56.570
Which of these teams
will advance to the finals?

00:02:56.570 --> 00:02:59.730
The matches
are about to begin!

00:02:59.730 --> 00:03:02.000
So we're the third match.

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:07.710
Including us, there are five teams left
with the chance of getting to the finals.

00:03:07.710 --> 00:03:09.260
So this battle
will be desperate.

00:03:09.260 --> 00:03:13.480
We've come all this way, so don't
obsess over the wins and losses.

00:03:13.480 --> 00:03:17.750
We just have to give it our
all in this one last match!

00:03:18.610 --> 00:03:20.360
Well, yeah.

00:03:20.360 --> 00:03:24.920
We have to win this next
match if we want to go to the finals,

00:03:24.920 --> 00:03:27.730
so we can't let ourselves
worry about the little stuff.

00:03:27.730 --> 00:03:31.510
Whatever!
I'm gonna become number one!

00:03:31.510 --> 00:03:32.960
It's starting.

00:03:34.170 --> 00:03:36.490
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:03:36.490 --> 00:03:40.520
Thank you for waiting! This is
the final stage before the finals!

00:03:40.520 --> 00:03:43.280
The first match
is about to start!

00:03:48.050 --> 00:03:52.920
First up, the most popular team of
the tournament! Barthez Soldat!

00:03:52.920 --> 00:03:56.140
Coach Barthez has made
a sudden return home!

00:03:56.140 --> 00:04:00.750
And unfortunately, Barthez
Soldat can't make it to the finals,

00:04:00.750 --> 00:04:05.450
but what kind of battle will
they fight without their coach?

00:04:05.450 --> 00:04:08.320
Their opponents,
F-Sangre, sits at two wins!

00:04:08.320 --> 00:04:12.660
Unless they win this match, their path
to the finals will crumble before them!

00:04:12.660 --> 00:04:16.830
Are they going to request their
specialty, the four-man battle?

00:04:19.300 --> 00:04:23.980
Wow! Julia is heading up
to the stadium alone!

00:04:23.980 --> 00:04:27.520
This is unusual for such
an important match!

00:04:31.730 --> 00:04:36.040
Please, sis!
I want to fight alone.

00:04:36.830 --> 00:04:38.040
What?

00:04:38.260 --> 00:04:41.890
Please let me fight a
one-on-one battle. Just this once.

00:04:41.890 --> 00:04:44.040
Is that okay?

00:04:45.650 --> 00:04:47.380
Alone?

00:04:47.380 --> 00:04:49.700
What's brings this
up all of a sudden?

00:04:49.700 --> 00:04:51.660
It's not sudden.

00:04:51.660 --> 00:04:54.510
I've been thinking it
over for a while now.

00:04:54.510 --> 00:04:55.680
For a while?

00:04:56.450 --> 00:04:59.440
I can fight
on my own now.

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:01.970
I can do it
without your help, sis!

00:05:01.970 --> 00:05:02.990
So please!

00:05:02.990 --> 00:05:06.770
No! We have to win
tomorrow's match!

00:05:06.770 --> 00:05:12.130
We've made it this far. Did you forget
that we lost our earlier matches?

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:14.170
So I'll win this time!

00:05:14.170 --> 00:05:15.640
I said no.

00:05:15.640 --> 00:05:20.290
If we lose, that's the
end of the line for us!

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:24.500
That's exactly why. Tomorrow
might be our last match.

00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:27.650
If I don't do it
tomorrow, I'll regret it!

00:05:27.650 --> 00:05:28.680
I just know it!

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:30.010
Raul!

00:05:30.010 --> 00:05:31.890
I think it's a good idea.

00:05:32.120 --> 00:05:35.510
He says he can do it alone.
Why not let him try?

00:05:35.510 --> 00:05:37.710
No, but...

00:05:37.710 --> 00:05:40.070
You've worked
so hard together.

00:05:40.070 --> 00:05:43.570
You can trust Raul a
little more, right?

00:05:43.570 --> 00:05:45.230
Trust...

00:05:45.700 --> 00:05:47.890
Please, sis!

00:05:58.340 --> 00:06:00.720
Now Romero's
on his side, too?

00:06:00.720 --> 00:06:03.650
I didn't go against Raul
because I wanted to.

00:06:03.650 --> 00:06:05.600
Even I...

00:06:05.850 --> 00:06:08.880
Go, Thunder Pegasus!

00:06:08.880 --> 00:06:10.980
Not gonna happen!

00:06:10.980 --> 00:06:17.620
What a graceful battle! Mihael and
Julia's battle is heating up beautifully!

00:06:25.580 --> 00:06:29.410
Doesn't matter to me.
I can win on my own.

00:06:29.410 --> 00:06:33.780
Wow! I thought F-Sangre was
better at four-man battles but...

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:36.100
They're strong
enough on their own!

00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:40.210
But it's weird... Why now, in
such an important battle?

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:42.250
Don't worry about that!

00:06:42.250 --> 00:06:46.470
I don't get why, but at least the battle
I'm watching is so cool! So who cares!

00:06:46.470 --> 00:06:50.030
Yeah! As long as the
battle's good, who cares?

00:06:50.030 --> 00:06:51.580
That's it! Go for it!

00:06:51.580 --> 00:06:53.620
Don't lose to her, Mihael!

00:07:04.510 --> 00:07:06.610
F-Sangre's not bad!

00:07:06.610 --> 00:07:09.010
Go get him, Julia!

00:07:10.540 --> 00:07:21.120
--Julia!

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:23.670
Okay! I'm counting on you!

00:07:23.670 --> 00:07:26.370
Thunder Pegasus!

00:07:30.210 --> 00:07:34.450
Thunder Pegasus's power has increased
in proportion to the audience's cheers!

00:07:34.450 --> 00:07:36.300
What? No way.

00:07:36.300 --> 00:07:37.540
Look!

00:07:37.540 --> 00:07:39.780
Go!!

00:07:48.200 --> 00:07:51.780
I'm going to show
you all what I can do!

00:07:51.780 --> 00:07:54.220
Toda La Fuerza!
<b><i> ("Full Force")</i></b>

00:07:57.790 --> 00:08:02.010
Fire Execution!

00:08:06.260 --> 00:08:08.830
Both of their special
moves have come out!

00:08:08.830 --> 00:08:12.000
Who's going to survive?!

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:14.210
--Go!!

00:08:25.960 --> 00:08:27.990
We have a winner!

00:08:29.650 --> 00:08:34.300
Julia of F-Sangre
wins the first battle!

00:08:37.970 --> 00:08:41.210
Sis fought such an
amazing battle on her own...

00:08:44.860 --> 00:08:47.150
No, I can...

00:08:47.150 --> 00:08:50.050
I can fight by
myself and win!

00:08:53.430 --> 00:08:56.730
They're all
cheering for me!

00:08:56.730 --> 00:08:58.350
It's the best!

00:08:58.350 --> 00:09:01.600
Bravo! You're in
tip-top shape, Julia!

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:02.530
Thanks.

00:09:02.530 --> 00:09:06.670
How was it? Fighting alone
doesn't feel half bad, does it?

00:09:08.280 --> 00:09:10.610
Yeah, it's not too bad.

00:09:13.390 --> 00:09:15.440
Don't keep them waiting.

00:09:15.440 --> 00:09:18.720
Go out there and get
them to cheer for you too!

00:09:27.410 --> 00:09:30.500
You're as harsh as ever.

00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:31.610
Really?

00:09:35.760 --> 00:09:38.590
Sorry, guys.

00:09:39.060 --> 00:09:40.560
You were close.

00:09:40.560 --> 00:09:43.030
It was a good battle.

00:09:44.470 --> 00:09:46.440
Claude. Aaron.

00:09:52.570 --> 00:09:54.800
Hold on a sec!

00:09:54.800 --> 00:09:57.620
We're counting on you to win
the second battle, Matilda.

00:09:58.750 --> 00:10:01.980
But my Beyblade is...

00:10:13.210 --> 00:10:14.840
What is this?

00:10:15.740 --> 00:10:18.070
It's a present from us.

00:10:18.070 --> 00:10:22.060
You regret what happened
to Pierce Hedgehog, right?

00:10:22.060 --> 00:10:25.620
We can't leave this
tournament with any regrets.

00:10:26.420 --> 00:10:28.950
Mihael... Claude...

00:10:28.950 --> 00:10:30.640
Aaron...

00:10:33.120 --> 00:10:36.660
Go on. Battle to
your heart's content.

00:10:40.100 --> 00:10:43.350
Thank you...
Thank you all!

00:10:44.010 --> 00:10:47.730
It's time to start
the second battle!

00:10:47.730 --> 00:10:50.720
From F-Sangre, Raul!

00:10:50.720 --> 00:10:55.390
And whoa! From
Barthez Soldat, it's Matilda!

00:10:55.390 --> 00:10:58.190
Are the two
of you ready?

00:10:58.190 --> 00:11:01.470
Second match, second battle!

00:11:01.860 --> 00:11:03.780
I can do it, too!

00:11:03.780 --> 00:11:05.570
I can...!

00:11:05.570 --> 00:11:08.160
I won't waste
my friends' feelings.

00:11:08.160 --> 00:11:09.700
I'm gonna fight!

00:11:09.700 --> 00:11:13.330
Three! Two! One!

00:11:13.330 --> 00:11:15.020
--Go, Shoot!

00:11:17.150 --> 00:11:24.950
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade G-Revolution"

00:11:27.650 --> 00:11:32.550
Each player is sizing
up the other's moves!

00:11:32.550 --> 00:11:35.890
Will Matilda be the first
to go on the attack?

00:11:35.890 --> 00:11:38.250
Or will it be Raul?

00:11:40.840 --> 00:11:43.760
That's a weird Beyblade.

00:11:43.760 --> 00:11:45.300
Oh, I get it.

00:11:45.700 --> 00:11:50.700
It appears as if it has been made
from the parts of her teammates.

00:11:50.700 --> 00:11:52.610
From Mihael and them?

00:11:55.200 --> 00:11:57.410
So they did it!

00:11:57.410 --> 00:12:00.800
I'm free to fight
as I please, right?

00:12:01.450 --> 00:12:04.450
Okay, then here I go!

00:12:10.240 --> 00:12:12.890
Darn it! Here I come!

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:16.400
Again!

00:12:16.400 --> 00:12:17.810
Now!

00:12:19.940 --> 00:12:22.770
No... I can't make it
move like I want it to!

00:12:22.770 --> 00:12:24.690
What the heck's he doing?

00:12:24.690 --> 00:12:27.260
He's overthinking it.

00:12:27.260 --> 00:12:29.640
Maybe he wasn't ready.

00:12:29.640 --> 00:12:31.560
It's too late for that now.

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:34.500
Why am I
screwing this up?

00:12:34.500 --> 00:12:36.820
Why can't I
fight like my sister?

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:39.000
Sis...

00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:42.450
When they applaud me...

00:12:42.450 --> 00:12:44.910
My sister was always
there next to me.

00:12:44.910 --> 00:12:49.010
The one everyone had their eyes on...
Was the one who shone in their own path...

00:12:49.010 --> 00:12:50.410
My sister!

00:12:51.330 --> 00:12:54.100
My sister can shine alone...

00:12:54.100 --> 00:12:56.720
But I can't...!

00:12:57.730 --> 00:12:59.730
Crap!!

00:13:04.300 --> 00:13:10.190
Uh-oh! He isn't gracefully
attacking like he usually does!

00:13:10.370 --> 00:13:13.700
What's the matter, Raul?

00:13:14.020 --> 00:13:17.000
I can... I can...!

00:13:20.320 --> 00:13:25.000
What's going on? This is a totally
different feel compared to the last match.

00:13:28.110 --> 00:13:31.840
Oh dear...
The audience is completely bored.

00:13:31.840 --> 00:13:36.390
Honestly... He just doesn't
get it, does he?

00:13:44.670 --> 00:13:46.800
Is this the end for me?

00:13:48.160 --> 00:13:51.040
Can't I do
anything by myself?

00:13:53.640 --> 00:13:55.100
I...

00:13:55.640 --> 00:13:58.090
Pull yourself together, Raul!

00:13:59.800 --> 00:14:01.200
Sis...!

00:14:01.830 --> 00:14:05.720
Do you think the audience is
going to applaud you like this?

00:14:05.720 --> 00:14:09.570
What you need right
now is confidence!

00:14:09.570 --> 00:14:10.920
Got it?

00:14:11.540 --> 00:14:13.410
But you're different!

00:14:13.410 --> 00:14:16.740
I knew we were different!

00:14:16.740 --> 00:14:18.030
You moron!

00:14:18.990 --> 00:14:23.830
We're siblings! We were born
together, and we struggle together!

00:14:23.830 --> 00:14:27.090
We've always gotten
plenty of applause together!

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:31.310
And that's because
you were there, Raul!

00:14:32.160 --> 00:14:33.860
Sis...

00:14:34.500 --> 00:14:40.320
We couldn't have pulled off even the hardest of moves if you didn't believe in yourself!

00:14:40.320 --> 00:14:44.920
So I believe in you, Raul!

00:14:44.920 --> 00:14:47.440
You... Believe in me?

00:14:49.250 --> 00:14:52.200
So you need to
believe in yourself!

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:55.420
You'll be fine.
You can win this!

00:14:55.420 --> 00:14:58.290
I can win?

00:14:58.520 --> 00:15:02.000
Now's my chance! Go!

00:15:04.560 --> 00:15:07.010
Pierce Hedgehog!

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:13.160
Whoa! Matilda sees her chance
and makes an attack!

00:15:13.160 --> 00:15:17.530
Raul's got his back turned!
Is this the end of the match?

00:15:18.890 --> 00:15:21.300
I can win!

00:15:22.610 --> 00:15:24.320
Go!!

00:15:35.710 --> 00:15:38.630
This is it! This is it, Sis!

00:15:38.630 --> 00:15:42.240
No one's going to applaud me
if I don't believe in myself!

00:15:42.240 --> 00:15:44.200
It's the same
for my Beyblade!

00:15:44.200 --> 00:15:49.300
And their support gives
me more confidence!

00:15:49.300 --> 00:15:51.200
There it is again!

00:15:51.200 --> 00:15:55.510
Flame Pegasus's movements
changed because of the cheering!

00:15:55.510 --> 00:15:59.440
I've always gotten cheered
on along with my sister!

00:15:59.440 --> 00:16:01.890
My sister and I are
one and the same!

00:16:01.890 --> 00:16:05.780
And this is
how we fight!

00:16:09.280 --> 00:16:11.240
Yes! Keep it up!

00:16:11.240 --> 00:16:13.480
Go, Flame Pegasus!

00:16:13.920 --> 00:16:16.510
Fuerza Valiente!
<b><i> ("Brave Force")</i></b>

00:16:33.710 --> 00:16:37.050
Raul's special move
finishes the battle!

00:16:37.400 --> 00:16:39.910
F-Sangre wins the
second battle as well!

00:16:39.910 --> 00:16:44.690
With their third win, their dream of
making it to the finals is a reality!

00:16:46.770 --> 00:16:49.430
I won! I actually won!

00:16:49.680 --> 00:16:52.000
I really won!

00:17:00.170 --> 00:17:02.000
I lost...

00:17:02.480 --> 00:17:04.000
Even so...

00:17:05.980 --> 00:17:07.720
Thank you!

00:17:09.120 --> 00:17:11.830
It was fun to go
all out in a battle.

00:17:11.830 --> 00:17:14.590
And you've got
a wonderful sister!

00:17:15.420 --> 00:17:16.680
Yeah.

00:17:17.170 --> 00:17:19.520
Keep it up.

00:17:19.950 --> 00:17:22.900
Thank you. I will.

00:17:23.810 --> 00:17:25.900
F-Sangre's still in.

00:17:25.900 --> 00:17:30.120
I've never heard of a team that gets
stronger from the audience's cheers.

00:17:30.120 --> 00:17:35.820
I never thought he'd make use of the
combo attack he uses with Julia...

00:17:36.170 --> 00:17:41.030
Every Blader is improving
through the world championships.

00:17:41.030 --> 00:17:42.850
And we have to as well!

00:17:42.850 --> 00:17:46.140
Yeah! Dang, I'm fired up now!

00:17:46.140 --> 00:17:49.390
Let's do it!
I'm gonna do it!

00:17:49.390 --> 00:17:51.520
Here we go again...

00:17:52.530 --> 00:17:55.160
Well done, Raul.

00:17:55.160 --> 00:17:58.780
Are you happy now?
After fighting alone.

00:17:58.780 --> 00:18:03.710
Well, I was fighting alone,
but I wasn't really alone.

00:18:05.960 --> 00:18:10.960
Next time, I'd like to get
applause with you again, Sis...

00:18:10.960 --> 00:18:13.420
What's gotten into you?

00:18:17.280 --> 00:18:20.000
All's well that
ends well, right?

00:18:20.000 --> 00:18:22.530
You proved that you're
strong enough by yourselves.

00:18:22.530 --> 00:18:27.140
The next four-man battle's
going to be a little different!

00:18:27.140 --> 00:18:29.550
You're a real optimist,
you know that?

00:18:34.640 --> 00:18:36.750
That's the end for us.

00:18:36.750 --> 00:18:39.900
Yeah. It kind of
hurts, doesn't it?

00:18:40.100 --> 00:18:43.460
But it was really fun
at the end there!

00:18:43.460 --> 00:18:44.770
Really?

00:18:47.060 --> 00:18:50.700
I'll never forget
this Beyblade.

00:18:50.700 --> 00:18:52.100
Never.

00:18:52.100 --> 00:18:54.490
It reminds me of
the four of us.

00:18:55.790 --> 00:19:00.070
Even if the parts are of different types,
put them together and it creates one Bey.

00:19:03.890 --> 00:19:07.250
I'd like to return to
the world stage again.

00:19:08.170 --> 00:19:12.000
Yeah, we'll be back.
All four of us!

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:15.280
The heated battles continue
into the final stage!

00:19:15.280 --> 00:19:17.400
As for the next match...

00:19:17.590 --> 00:19:22.080
Again, this team's entry to
the finals is riding on this battle!

00:19:22.080 --> 00:19:23.890
Baihuzu!

00:19:24.580 --> 00:19:29.860
And if Neo-Borg wins, their
road to the finals will be all set!

00:19:29.860 --> 00:19:34.440
This fan-favorite match-up
is finally about to begin!

00:19:39.070 --> 00:19:43.150
Come on, Takao. We need to
prepare for our next match.

00:19:43.150 --> 00:19:46.010
I know that, but...

00:19:55.030 --> 00:19:58.580
Darn! I can't watch such a
good battle in the stands...

00:19:58.580 --> 00:20:02.090
Rei, Kai, I don't want
either of you to lose!

00:20:02.530 --> 00:20:04.590
Third match, first battle!

00:20:04.590 --> 00:20:08.000
Rai from Baihuzu
takes to the stage!

00:20:08.200 --> 00:20:11.630
Rai. I have nothing
left to say to you.

00:20:11.630 --> 00:20:13.350
The first battle
is all on you.

00:20:13.350 --> 00:20:18.020
Yeah. Rei, I promise I'll win,
and pass the torch to you.

00:20:18.300 --> 00:20:20.450
We're counting on you, Rai.

00:20:20.450 --> 00:20:22.530
Good luck, Rai!

00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:31.730
His opponent from
Neo-Borg will be Yuriy Ivanov!

00:20:33.970 --> 00:20:38.960
Who's going to win this
decisive battle? Rai or Yuriy?

00:20:39.200 --> 00:20:41.350
I won't let you beat me!

00:20:41.350 --> 00:20:43.290
I'm sending you
back to the stands!

00:20:43.290 --> 00:20:46.320
We'll see who sends who.

00:20:46.320 --> 00:20:47.520
Bring it on!

00:20:48.970 --> 00:20:50.800
Here we go!

00:20:50.800 --> 00:20:54.020
Three! Two! One!

00:20:54.020 --> 00:20:56.140
--Go, Shoot!

00:20:56.140 --> 00:20:58.000
Go, Galeon!

00:20:58.860 --> 00:21:02.800
Rai dishes out a powerful
attack from the get-go!

00:21:02.800 --> 00:21:05.810
But Yuriy's Wolborg
is taking it all!

00:21:05.810 --> 00:21:10.700
And Rai's on fire! He unleashes
his raw destructive force!

00:21:10.920 --> 00:21:12.290
Keep it up!

00:21:12.290 --> 00:21:14.490
Go for it, Rai!

00:22:55.530 --> 00:22:56.330
--Rei!

00:22:56.330 --> 00:22:57.170
Rei!

00:22:57.170 --> 00:23:00.900
What's wrong, Rei?
You promised us!

00:23:00.900 --> 00:23:05.060
That we'd make it to the finals
and become world champions!

00:23:05.060 --> 00:23:09.240
He's right! This isn't the
time for me to be laying down!

00:23:09.240 --> 00:23:12.360
My best friends...
The greatest stage...!

00:23:12.360 --> 00:23:15.330
And my ultimate rival
is waiting for me!

00:23:15.330 --> 00:23:20.210
Not yet!
I will never lose!

00:23:20.210 --> 00:23:22.210
Let's do this, Kai!
